			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2250000000000002"
			title: "Understand Channels"
			description: ["Fluix Smart Cable shows channel usage directly on the cable. Build with it while learning AE2: if devices disappear from the network, inspect channel saturation before replacing machines or storage. Coloured smart cables use their own registry IDs; the uncoloured cable is fluix_smart_cable."]
			x: 2.5d
